@meeting introBunk
// The arrival evening, step A7 (plans/pillar4-plan.md Part 1): Torres shows you Bunk 1 and hands you your device.
// Tomas may be there (Sunday evening). The head writer's lines, replacing section 21's stand-in. You're berth 4,
// the upper bunk above Zofia Santos's; Tomas is berth 1, by the door, under his star map.
title: Your bunk
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Torres showed you Bunk 1 and your locker, and handed you your device.
== lines
torres-zeke: Bunk 1. Home. Top bunk at the back is yours.   [gesture]
torres-zeke > you: Your locker's under it. Bag in there. Go on, it's yours now.
tomas: Oh! You're here! Hi. I'm Tomas. Watch. Bottom bunk, by the door.
tomas > you: I only got here last Sunday. So I'm not the newest any more. Sorry. I'm very pleased about that.
torres-zeke: Tomas will show you the washroom in the morning. Won't you, Tomas.
tomas: Yes! It's left at the end. It's left. It's probably left.
torres-zeke > you: And this is yours too. Your device. Mail, your schedule, maps, the lot.   [gesture]
torres-zeke: It'll want to say hello. They always do. Let it.
? choice
* What do I do first?   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:practical
  torres-zeke: Dinner. Always dinner first. Then everything else.   [nod]
* Is it always this much?   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:share
  torres-zeke: First night, yes. By Thursday it's just home with a lift in it.   [nod]
* (Just nod)
  torres-zeke: Good. The quiet ones last longest.
torres-zeke: Right, onward. The mess is on Deck 3, and Brennan doesn't hold plates for anyone.   [gesture]
